{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d2133e06-ffde-8c84-a1d0-b7d775b1e1ed",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T10:35:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:33:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Please, excuse me, I would like to report a problem in the road. There is a dip where the utility workers opened the street and then closed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dip where there was a utility trench. Do you know where that is? A street name, or a cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:34:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is on Thames Street, near the corner by the crosswalk, in front of the small thrift shop. I am going there now to drop off a bag of clothes, a donation, so I am looking at it right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Thames Street by the crosswalk near the thrift shop. And the trench has settled, so it's sunk down below the rest of the pavement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. The patch went down, and it is like a long hole now. Please understand, it has water inside from the rain, and the water is very still, so you cannot see how deep it is. A car can go in very fast and hit it hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:34:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's filled with water and hard to see, and that makes it a hazard for drivers. About how long is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perhaps, um, the length of one car. And across, maybe half of the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One car length, half the lane. Okay. I'm putting that in as a settled utility cut with standing water, on Thames Street by the crosswalk near the thrift shop. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Would you like a callback number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four-zero-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-seven. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, one more thing. Could you give me a reference number for this report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me get that up. [pause] Okay, your reference number is P-W-two-six-oh-two-one-four. I'll say it again: P, W, two, six, oh, two, one, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P, W, two, six, zero, two, one, four. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. A crew will take a look at it. Have a good day, and thanks for calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T10:35:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
